\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  O Love, who formedst me to wear
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The image of Thy God heard here;
\par Who soughtest me with tender care
\par Through all my wanderings wild and drear:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Love, I give myself to Thee,
\par Thine ever, only Thine to be.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  O Love, who ere life's earliest morn
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 On me Thy choice hast gently laid;
\par O Love, who here as Man wast born,
\par And wholly like to us wast made:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Love, I give myself to Thee,
\par Thine ever, only Thine to be.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  O Love, who once in time wast slain,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Pierced through and through with bitter woe;
\par O Love, who wrestling thus didst gain
\par That we eternal joy might know:
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Love, I give myself to Thee,
\par Thine ever, only Thine to be.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  O Love, who lovest me for aye,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Who for my soul dost ever plead;
\par O Love, who didst my ransom pay,
\par Whose power sufficeth in my stead:
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Love, I give myself to Thee,
\par Thine ever, only Thine to be.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  O Love, whose voice shall bid me rise
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 From out this dying life of ours;
\par O Love, whose hand o'er yonder skies
\par Shall set me in the fadeless bowers:
\par O Love, I give myself to Thee,
\par Thine ever, only Thine to be.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Love, I give myself to Thee,
\par Thine ever, only Thine to be.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

